# BuildKit-specific override: for `docker build -f web/Dockerfile .`, this file replaces the
# root .dockerignore (which excludes web/embed/e2e entirely — needed here for npm workspace
# resolution and the embed alias). Keeps the web build context lean without losing web/Dockerfile's
# actual dependencies (contracts/deployments, api/src for sync:openapi, embed/src, web/, sim/).
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/dist-demo
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
.git
.cursor
contracts/out
web/.cache
api/.cache
api/alembic
